eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=re1FFutkDasQ7kNvwGltwMH&_nc_oc=Adlxvgsd3G0tSC_Nr5_STEGEcT1pNeQQNbzs2tdNO_kvrvlOPoIEIkk_woPxVub6D78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyP2RJwuWcyyylyBMMy-n9Y4GnHcBB2_pkH6GNDGmGzJQ&oe=69AFF3DC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8jd1p6ugrmsQ7kNvwHZYMgs&_nc_oc=Adl1e4UZyF6yYTtAcaWpTgysgyk1f9hvPB8Q6F9UA8NgSv2Duoz_fvZ3XFH_VCBxFPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzsgpDZu2UqBnnXZkAehzGkjInyCfGpPilkaqc1KZunqw&oe=69B006A5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ADqqCO0z2bYQ7kNvwFcRTvK&_nc_oc=Adk3y0LO081ilI8dP0vg484gkPPB8zc0o4NsLUhL51x103AgI9c1QTTE7idPojXcf7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxN0H7_9aYweqSWdZ7RT-daSYiGRyBTd7F38gF-U1rtNQ&oe=69AFFAEC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V0s_ghp81-IQ7kNvwGz-J8f&_nc_oc=AdkbUI9oMkvwofsDwY6qJOYySklgV1dGQJGSlBY5f5Iwzo96TVl2tJ2Kmcp1oU-Bvbg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxWw_IwPsJANGCLz6u678hEwlfZhdr6Bc7LsiEpmK_ZLA&oe=69B000AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KU4QvAiKA-AQ7kNvwFE8E1J&_nc_oc=AdkvsmIwaPY610TkFIK-4CqMykDwx_VNVQlIVgIF_zH6Q4hw-fenGRjL4QtE7perobQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfymSLLirv-WA1cqsweA3CqnmMKwMSNeay6M2oW0dROxkw&oe=69B02056"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam